--TEST--
Core\Str::length counts graphemes where strlen counts bytes
--ORACLE-DIVERGES--
ADR 0009 § 2: `string` is text and its unit is the extended grapheme cluster, so `strlen`'s byte count is the wrong answer, not a different one.
--FILE--
<?nvs
echo Core\Str::length("héllo"), "\n";
echo Core\Str::length("e\u{0301}"), "\n";
echo Core\Str::length("👍🏽"), "\n";
--EXPECT--
5
1
1
